    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on levin-2022-tame-27: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.67";
    dc:description "Ectopic eye formation and tissue location are clear anatomical outcomes. Published evidence can test the ion-channel result, but a clean superiority comparison with Pax6 and the evolutionary interpretation are less well supported.";
    dc:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Score complete eye structures and tissue locations after ion-channel induction, Pax6 induction, and matched controls, verifying the predicted voltage state and comparing retinal differentiation and connectivity.";
