    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Complete raw image sets may not be public.", "Cross-study comparison with Pax6 may use different species, stages, and delivery methods.", "Master-regulator status is broader than eye induction.";
